      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDouble-fronted semi-detached bungalow. Situated within walking distance of Waterford City centre and all amenities, convenient to local shops, schools, and bus services. The property is in poor condition throughout and requires full modernisation and renovation.\n\nThe accommodation extends to c.42 sq.m. (456 sq.ft.) There is a front and rear garden. \n\nWe understand that the property has been vacant for more than two years and may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the terms and conditions of the scheme and purchaser eligibility.\n\nWe are instructed to sell this property by Waterford City and County Council. This property is currently on the Council's Derelict Sites Register. It should be noted that the property must be removed from dereliction and brought back in to active use within a timely fashion after the closing date of a sale (c.12 month). If you would like to make an offer for this property please email info@osheaotoole.com and provide the following information with your offer; Confirmation you have viewed the property, and if so, on what date, the amount you are willing to offer, how you will finance the purchase if your offer is accepted. If you have questions relating to this property please email info@osheaotoole.com\n\n"
      }
